# SEVERITY

Use:

CRITICAL
Unauthorized financial gain/loss, account-wide financial compromise, unrestricted high-cost resource abuse, or privilege escalation involving value.

HIGH
Reliable abuse of credits, billing, entitlements, payments, quotas, or expensive resources.

MEDIUM
Meaningful but constrained economic or authorization abuse.

LOW
Minor inconsistencies with limited practical impact.

INFO
Hardening opportunity.

